://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fancyhe1","id":98204410,"login":"Fancyhe1","node_id":"U_kgDOBdp6-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmed11551/namaz2911/commits/8b40d283ecc267143268a8b1b8e007c0ef5318a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-29T10:17:13Z","email":"dev@example.com","name":"Openfire Plugin Developer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-29T10:17:13Z","email":"dev@example.com","name":"Openfire Plugin Developer"},"message":"Design: Комплексное улучшение дизайна - унификация, spacing, иерархия\n\n Унифицированы стили карточек:\n- Единый стиль: rounded-2xl, border, shadow-sm\n- Увеличен padding: p-6 sm:p-8\n- Улучшены CardHeader, CardContent, CardFooter\n\n Упрощены страницы:\n- Убраны лишние анимации (slide-up, stagger, breathing-glow)\n- Упрощены табы без лишних эффектов\n- Убраны hover-lift, ripple эффекты где не нужны\n\n Добавлено больше белого пространства:\n- Увеличены отступы: mb-6 sm:mb-8 вместо mb-4\n- Улучшен spacing между элементами: space-y-4  space-y-6\n- Увеличен padding контейнеров: px-4 sm:px-6, py-6 sm:py-8\n- Улучшены отступы в карточках целей\n\n Улучшена визуальная иерархия:\n- Увеличены размеры заголовков: h1 text-3xl sm:text-4xl\n- Добавлены отступы для заголовков: mb-4 sm:mb-6\n- Улучшена типографика с лучшими отступами\n- Улучшен контраст через размеры шрифтов\n\n Оптимизированы анимации:\n- Увеличены длительности (менее навязчиво)\n- Добавлена поддержка prefers-reduced-motion\n- Упрощены переходы где возможно","tree":{"sha":"37e41c3ead867526626fb7621db7676d0fc60f24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmed11551/namaz2911/git/trees/37e41c3ead867526626fb7621db7676d0fc60f24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmed11551/namaz2911/git/commits/8b40d283ecc267143268a8b1b8e007c0ef5318a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98204410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fancyhe1","id":98204410,"login":"Fancyhe1","node_id":"U_kgDOBdp6-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ahmed11551/namaz2911/commit/8b40d283ecc267143268a8b1b8e007c0ef5318a9","node_id":"C_kwDOQfLdLdoAKDhiNDBkMjgzZWNjMjY3MTQzMjY4YThiMWI4ZTAwN2MwZWY1MzE4YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ahmed11551/namaz2911/commit/94ccfbddf42688135f0142356086313010421439","sha":"94ccfbddf42688135f0142356086313010421439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ahmed11551/namaz2911/commits/94ccfbddf42688135f01423560863