thakagrawal927/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarthakagrawal927","id":43884471,"login":"sarthakagrawal927","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg0NDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commits/1d469dd9c5207cc28325e702361922eb7911e4ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:40:26Z","email":"43884471+sarthakagrawal927@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sarthak Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T20:40:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add PostHog page_view tracking (#52)\n\n* test(seo): add sitemap/canonical parity regression check\n\nCloses #47\n\nIssue #47: the live sitemap listed /faq and /login with the homepage\ncanonical. The runtime fixes (self-canonical for /faq, /login removed\nfrom the sitemap, noindex on /login) shipped in #48. This adds the\nmissing regression guard so the parity cannot silently regress:\n\n- For every URL in public/sitemap.xml, resolve its landing-astro source\n  page and assert it declares a self-canonical (canonicalPath == its own\n  pathname). The homepage keeps the Layout default ''/''.\n- Assert /login never re-enters the sitemap.\n- Reuses the existing sitemapUrls() helper and AGENT_SURFACE catalog.\n\n* feat: add page_view event to complete 5-event taxonomy\n\nAdd page_view as the 5th event alongside signup, activated, core_action,\nand returned. Wire trackPageView() into RootLayout on mount and route changes.\n\nPart of fleet-workspace#348\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef86746e3fe578f4973463824976b98a7b34bad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/trees/ef86746e3fe578f4973463824976b98a7b34bad5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/commits/1d469dd9c5207cc28325e702361922eb7911e4ed","verification":{"payload":"tree ef86746e3fe578f4973463824976b98a7b34bad5\nparent e9b4e63ec61ac57078c9df8697f30fc3725041a1\nauthor Sarthak Agrawal <43884471+sarthakagrawal927@users.noreply.github.com> 1786826426 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786826426 +0530\n\nfeat: add PostHog page_view tracking (#52)\n\n* test(seo): add sitemap/canonical parity regression check\n\nCloses #47\n\nIssue #47: the live sitemap listed /faq and /login with the homepage\ncanonical. The runtime fixes (self-canonical for /faq, /login removed\nfrom the sitemap, noindex on /login) shipped in #48. This adds the\nmissing regression guard so the parity cannot silently regress:\n\n- For every URL in public/sitemap.xml, resolve its landing-astro source\n  page and assert it declares a self-canonical (canonicalPath == its own\n  pathname). The homepage keeps the Layout default ''/''.\n- Assert /login never re-enters the sitemap.\n- Reuses the existing sitemapUrls() helper and AGENT_SURFACE catalog.\n\n* feat: add page_view event to complete 5-event taxonomy\n\nAdd page_view as the 5th event alongside signup, activated, core_action,\nand returned. Wire trackPageView() into RootLayout on mount and route changes.\n\nPart of fleet-workspace#348\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-int