api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commits/4b0988b82bbc4fcc46312a0b95336b55077ad19f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:12:10Z","email":"43884471+sarthakagrawal927@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sarthak Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T07:12:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(seo): add sitemap/canonical parity regression check (#50)\n\nCloses #47\n\nIssue #47: the live sitemap listed /faq and /login with the homepage\ncanonical. The runtime fixes (self-canonical for /faq, /login removed\nfrom the sitemap, noindex on /login) shipped in #48. This adds the\nmissing regression guard so the parity cannot silently regress:\n\n- For every URL in public/sitemap.xml, resolve its landing-astro source\n  page and assert it declares a self-canonical (canonicalPath == its own\n  pathname). The homepage keeps the Layout default ''/''.\n- Assert /login never re-enters the sitemap.\n- Reuses the existing sitemapUrls() helper and AGENT_SURFACE catalog.","tree":{"sha":"aff3a917a0b17c4a51349f04f426e356fae39e48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/trees/aff3a917a0b17c4a51349f04f426e356fae39e48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/commits/4b0988b82bbc4fcc46312a0b95336b55077ad19f","verification":{"payload":"tree aff3a917a0b17c4a51349f04f426e356fae39e48\nparent 9ab3c4e2bda01103d2897f614c5a1ef99e420e12\nauthor Sarthak Agrawal <43884471+sarthakagrawal927@users.noreply.github.com> 1786777930 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786777930 +0530\n\ntest(seo): add sitemap/canonical parity regression check (#50)\n\nCloses #47\n\nIssue #47: the live sitemap listed /faq and /login with the homepage\ncanonical. The runtime fixes (self-canonical for /faq, /login removed\nfrom the sitemap, noindex on /login) shipped in #48. This adds the\nmissing regression guard so the parity cannot silently regress:\n\n- For every URL in public/sitemap.xml, resolve its landing-astro source\n  page and assert it declares a self-canonical (canonicalPath == its own\n  pathname). The homepage keeps the Layout default ''/''.\n- Assert /login never re-enters the sitemap.\n- Reuses the existing sitemapUrls() helper and AGENT_SURFACE catalog.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgBFKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4WsQAB8Bn5vWC4ZPk00kqJfbopEr\nnTtojs3Grg1aE1Rf0pCajNU0rfkRcUYFIQ7BblPC0w2mw7iABY28Dbh0fs4BN8d+\n8aM5mQ695nrOYurLRDYhIPc9Xsx5HnWDxW+xL+FNcOaGa6gsUhYTQj3t8QMwcCpr\nOLsRa/Hc0QheU4zKoMEqnBaZjMq2kw28EBcyh19A7hpE8Z58xrJTTHhKc2ZBgKOA\nyCqGIDwPx1ZEhtImWlF9Sz6L2XHLu33vOGGCk6mdnbfCM6F+5JRYLtfX7RuZBYVh\nt2VqglZR06Oyypvqpc89F4kmP8gYFlKuDYpezV8pCSBg5HGimYQI61Pnp9U2j8dy\nvHJh8reXyISBagKtDzVfRzywo33+kF44Ab6uuxY1l3dlHqu0TuxhGzgccYwekohL\n9egHNP/Q+eL4pPWL6gouRoWw83t7YyR67guqgIv5u1W3ei2Q+wsmJNCILCqF25dd\nzMYt9rcWh2CLGDMz469R5vmM+qEQJFQOR17YAQdhwBrRNZz210v0t5WyXJ3MFZ28\nVTbOW/R8zOgW1otjVNxBt0quDsmbTJQsEuNrv+GbBNsGZcX71y7tDDInAJvazHXi\nTMF5l4NptUiE7kV7iribEaIXiyFYnuj/Mz5ZUvr0BSqDgO4krAV9DqWDdLm7e12P\nget6ha9wBHMX5afLmy67\n=EdGb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-15T07:12:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","rep