pe":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commit/a8a68af8ce6ddb8e4311af619824860223f937bc","node_id":"C_kwDOQfeY39oAKGE4YTY4YWY4Y2U2ZGRiOGU0MzExYWY2MTk4MjQ4NjAyMjNmOTM3YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commit/50c994f7e2721ed870efc1dca29979cf6fe92ab7","sha":"50c994f7e2721ed870efc1dca29979cf6fe92ab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commits/50c994f7e2721ed870efc1dca29979cf6fe92ab7"}],"sha":"a8a68af8ce6ddb8e4311af619824860223f937bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commits/a8a68af8ce6ddb8e4311af619824860223f937bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43884471?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarthakagrawal927","id":43884471,"login":"sarthakagrawal927","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg0NDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commits/9ac83b22ce9c120982614fe44f5ea53fe7dce8cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:10:23Z","email":"sarthakagrawal927@gmail.com","name":"Sarthak Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:10:23Z","email":"sarthakagrawal927@gmail.com","name":"Sarthak Agrawal"},"message":"docs: accuracy pass — fix inaccuracies against actual code\n\nGrounded every corrected claim in the real Hono Worker / Vite SPA / Turso /\nR2 / AI-gateway / extension code.\n\n- data-flow.md: text/html Cache-Control is `no-cache, no-store,\n  must-revalidate` (from `withSecurityHeaders` in worker.ts), not the fabricated\n  `public, max-age=300, s-maxage=600, stale-while-revalidate=86400`; article\n  cache carries `public, max-age=300, s-maxage=300`. PDF key is\n  `pdfs/<userId>/<timestamp>-<sanitized-filename>` (storage.ts), not\n  `<uuid>.pdf`. Removed the non-existent server-side `pdf-parse` upload\n  extraction. Dropped anachronistic \"next dev\" phrasing. agent-edge list now\n  includes /sitemap.xml.\n- how-it-works.md: snapshot is `GET /api/snapshot?url=…` (not POST); note write\n  is `PUT /api/articles/:id` (no PATCH route) — fixed in prose and mermaid.\n- 0003-r2-pdfs.md: corrected storage-key format.\n- 0007-content-extraction.md: pdfjs workerSrc is set in PDFViewer.tsx via a\n  bundler URL (dist/assets/), not `public/pdf.worker.min.mjs`; there is no\n  `pdf-parse` (not a dependency); extracted_text is client-supplied (marked\n  TBD for direct webapp uploads).\n- learnings.md: same pdfjs worker correction; API keys are SHA-256-hashed\n  (sha256Hex in api-keys.ts), not HMAC; dropped \"next dev\" phrasing.\n- ci-cd.md: deploy.yml''s `deploy-preview` PR job never fires (workflow `on:` is\n  workflow_dispatch only).\n- AGENTS.md: de-linked the out-of-repo `../AGENTS.md` reference (kept intent) to\n  clear the sole broken link. docs:check now 0 broken links.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c746e69de73ba81607e22f1e9646978f91ccf27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/trees/7c746e69de73ba81607e22f1e9646978f91ccf27"},"url"