/sarthakagrawal927/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarthakagrawal927","id":43884471,"login":"sarthakagrawal927","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODg0NDcx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/commits/50c994f7e2721ed870efc1dca29979cf6fe92ab7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T14:08:41Z","email":"sarthakagrawal927@gmail.com","name":"Sarthak Agrawal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T14:08:41Z","email":"sarthakagrawal927@gmail.com","name":"Sarthak Agrawal"},"message":"docs: consolidate repository knowledge into local-first docs/ system\n\nBuild a maintainable, agent- and human-readable documentation system with\nMarkdown in docs/ as the source of truth and Blume as the presentation layer\nonly.\n\n- AGENTS.md: slimmed to a concise bootloader (purpose, commands, constraints,\n  docs navigation, maintenance rules); dropped the stale claude-mem-context.\n  Case-only rename agents.md -> AGENTS.md for fleet convention.\n- STATUS.md: new short current-state view (objective, active work, blockers,\n  unresolved questions, next steps). PROJECT_STATUS.md slimmed to a pointer\n  for fleet tooling that reads it by name.\n- docs/: new canonical tree — index, product (overview/features/surfaces),\n  architecture (overview/data-flow + 8 current ADRs), development\n  (setup/commands/conventions/testing/openspec), operations\n  (deploy/env/ci-cd/jobs + runbooks for schema/secrets/rollback), knowledge\n  (current learnings/external-references/failed-approaches), archive index.\n- docs/archive/: moved pre-Vite decisions.md, lessons.md, learning docs,\n  PROJECT_RECOMMENDATION_CONTEXT, AUDIT, Firebase migration plan + retro,\n  memory-capture plans, chrome-extension plan via git mv; added historical\n  markers pointing at current canonical docs. plans/ folder removed.\n- blume.config.ts: presentation-only config pointing at docs/ (archive/\n  excluded from the published site). Not part of the production build.\n- scripts/check-docs.mjs + pnpm docs:check: validates docs/ link integrity,\n  orphan files, required files, and canonical structure. CI wired via\n  .github/workflows/docs.yml on docs/AGENTS/STATUS/blume paths.\n- .gitignore: ignore Blume output (.blume/, docs-site/) and local agent logs.\n- package.json: add docs:check / docs:dev / docs:build scripts.\n\nUnrelated in-progress work (dist/, landing-astro pages, public/llms.txt,\nsrc/worker.ts) is preserved untouched.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"97c4c581d78e0a5959211ecdaf8241dc67aaddcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/trees/97c4c581d78e0a5959211ecdaf8241dc67aaddcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Significant-Hobbies/reader/git/commits/50c994f7e2721ed870efc1dca29979cf6fe92ab7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43884471?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakagrawal927/following{/other_