_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/5071c640b2031cf890ce2ae0b631c2f8ab35e6fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T07:49:09Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T07:49:09Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix: use scrollUntilVisible after language switch in i18n E2E test\n\nAfter tapping language toggle, use scrollUntilVisible to both wait for\nthe language change (text updates from \"Sign In\" to \"साइन इन करें\") AND\nscroll to make the title visible. This replaces the extendedWaitUntil\nwhich assumed the element would already be visible after language change.\n\nThe issue was that after scrolling down to verify social buttons, the\ntitle was off-screen. extendedWaitUntil expects elements to be visible,\nbut scrollUntilVisible will both wait and scroll to find the element.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"472c652f1002657c0307fad03eab16148bf75cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/472c652f1002657c0307fad03eab16148bf75cc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/5071c640b2031cf890ce2ae0b631c2f8ab35e6fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":