,{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/349601fb242b6dca5f761a385fce2660ccd3621c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:58:42Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:58:42Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): download iOS simulator runtime on macos-15 runners\n\nmacos-15 runners may not have iOS simulator runtimes pre-installed,\ncausing xcodebuild to fail with \"Unable to find a device matching the\nprovided destination specifier\". Add xcodebuild -downloadPlatform iOS\nstep to all 5 iOS jobs across ci.yml, e2e.yml, and release.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b125c935c1bef0e2d5c1e220df9b4fd9e3e7533","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/1b125c935c1bef0e2d5c1e220df9b4fd9e3e7533"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/349601fb242b6dca5f761a385fce2660ccd3621c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/349601fb242b6dca5f761a385fce2660ccd3621c","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKDM0OTYwMWZiMjQyYjZkY2E1Zjc2MWEzODVmY2UyNjYwY2NkMzYyMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e","sha":"67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e"}],"sha":"349601fb242b6dca5f761a385fce2660ccd3621c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/349601fb242b6dca5f761a385fce2660ccd3621c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:43:55Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T20:43:55Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): simplify emulator script and upgrade to macos-15 runners\n\nTwo root cause fixes for E2E test failures:\n\n1. Android: Remove counterproductive ADB restart and boot polling.\n   The android-emulator-runner action already waits for the emulator\n   to fully boot before running the script. Our script was calling\n   `adb kill-server` which disconnected from the emulator the action\n   just connected to, causing \"device offline\" errors and emulator\n   termination. The entire 60-line stability script is replaced with\n   a simple `adb install` + `maestro test`.\n\n2. iOS: Upgrade from macos-14 to macos-15 runners. The macos-14\n   runner image is being deprecated (fully unsupported Nov 2026) and\n   has known issues with missing iOS simulator runtimes. The macos-15\n   runner has Xcode 16.2 with iPhone 16 simulators on iOS 18.5+.\n\nApplied to e2e.yml, release.yml, and ci.yml (iOS build jobs).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fa7f076c667722a269653595a36b44f25b6ef24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/9fa7f076c667722a269653595a36b44f25b6ef24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKDY3ZGE2YWY3MWI5MTE2YzU3ZDI4ZmVjMGEzYzkzMGY4ZTdiYjY4OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d","sha":"e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d"}],"sha":"67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/67da6af71b9116c57d28fec0a3c930f8e7bb689e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T18:25:16Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T18:25:16Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): use Vercel recommended CI pattern for deploy URL capture\n\nReplace two-step capture+regex pattern (CLI_OUTPUT + grep) with\nVercel''s recommended approach where `vercel deploy` outputs just the\ndeployment URL to stdout. This is more reliable than parsing stderr\noutput with regex.\n\nApplied to all 4 Vercel deploy steps across release.yml and\ndeploy-staging.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a16e4f3d57e40090c9421a51c9293c8a67603471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/a16e4f3d57e40090c9421a51c9293c8a67603471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKGU0ZjE5NDc2MjY5Y2ZkOGFiODRhOTY2Nzk2MDQ2YWMxNjBhNzNiNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21","sha":"1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21"}],"sha":"e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/e4f19476269cfd8ab84a966796046ac160a73b4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T18:22:05Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T18:22:05Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): use Release builds for E2E tests (Debug needs dev server)\n\nRoot cause: React Native Debug builds don''t bundle JavaScript into the\napp binary. Instead, they load JS from a running Re.Pack dev server at\nruntime (Android: http://10.0.2.2:8081, iOS: http://localhost:8082).\nWithout a dev server, the app launches as an empty native shell with\nno React UI, causing all Maestro assertions to fail.\n\nThis was confirmed by the iOS logs where the simulator was stable and\nthe app installed successfully, but \"Universal MFE - Mobile\" was never\nvisible - the JS bundle simply never loaded.\n\nFix: Switch both Android and iOS E2E jobs from Debug to Release builds.\nRelease builds embed the JS bundle (main.jsbundle / index.android.bundle)\ndirectly into the app binary via Hermes bytecode compilation, making\nthe app fully self-contained with no dev server dependency.\n\nChanges in both e2e.yml and release.yml:\n- Android: Add codegen step, use assembleRelease with PLATFORM/NODE_ENV\n  env vars, update APK path to apk/release/app-release.apk\n- iOS: Add codegen step (with RN CLI exit code 1 tolerance), use\n  -configuration Release with NODE_ENV/PLATFORM env vars, verify\n  main.jsbundle exists in built app\n\nThe Android release signing gracefully falls back to the debug keystore\nwhen CI signing secrets aren''t provided (build.gradle lines 100-105),\nso no signing configuration is needed for E2E-only jobs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a9acbcbdeb8a6c2685560eb28af81c16252c825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/4a9acbcbdeb8a6c2685560eb28af81c16252c825"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKDE4MTBjMTRiZDkzODM3OGE1NjJjN2IwNzBkZDBlZjZlZWM0NWFlMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/dbaca3a36211ebf15650731665935586e6c83a81","sha":"dbaca3a36211ebf15650731665935586e6c83a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/dbaca3a36211ebf15650731665935586e6c83a81"}],"sha":"1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/1810c14bd938378a562c7b070dd0ef6eec45ae21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/dbaca3a36211ebf15650731665935586e6c83a81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T17:47:32Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T17:47:32Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): remove -no-snapshot flags causing emulator crash\n\nThe -no-snapshot-save and -no-snapshot-load flags cause the emulator\nto immediately terminate on GitHub Actions runners. The emulator tries\nto cold boot but the AVD state from the caching step becomes\ninconsistent, producing \"Emulator client has not yet been configured\"\nerrors. Removing these flags lets the emulator use the cached snapshot\nnormally, which is the intended behavior of the AVD caching step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9a64181c19d934eb725a4147b088fbcc37369ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/f9a64181c19d934eb725a4147b088fbcc37369ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/dbaca3a36211ebf15650731665935586e6c83a81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/dbaca3a36211ebf15650731665935586e6c83a81","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKGRiYWNhM2EzNjIxMWViZjE1NjUwNzMxNjY1OTM1NTg2ZTZjODNhODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/c