.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/e4809e667817b34a51b1073c55d23cca6191c2b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T17:15:17Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T17:15:17Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"refactor(ci): restructure CI/CD for world-class pipeline\n\nReplace fragmented CI/CD workflows with a unified, enterprise-grade\npipeline implementing mandatory E2E gates, staging environments, and\ntag-based production promotion.\n\nNew workflows:\n- e2e.yml: Consolidated E2E (Web + Android + iOS) running on every PR\n- deploy-staging.yml: Auto-deploy to staging on push to main\n- release.yml: Production release with E2E re-verification on v* tags\n\nRemoved workflows:\n- e2e-web.yml (was label-triggered, effectively optional)\n- deploy-web.yml (deployed to prod without E2E gate)\n- deploy-mobile-remote-bundles.yml (deployed to live channel directly)\n- release-mobile.yml (consolidated into release.yml)\n\nKey changes:\n- E2E tests now mandatory merge gates for ALL platforms\n- Staging environments: Vercel staging domains + Firebase staging channel\n- Production deployment only via tag with E2E re-verification\n- Zero manual steps (no labels, no manual triggers)\n- Updated ci.yml PR summary to reference new E2E workflow\n- Deleted conflicting GIT-FLOW-WORKFLOW.md\n- Updated CLAUDE.md and .cursorrules with new CI/CD references\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8be5bc3afd01ee6da1ea440d6d5bc5483dc18737","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/8be5bc3afd01ee6da1ea440d6d5bc5483dc18737"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/e4809e667817b34a51b1073c55d23cca6191c2b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/e4809e667817b34a51b1073c55d23cca6191c2b3","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKGU0ODA5ZTY2NzgxN2IzNGE1MWIxMDczYzU1ZDIzY2NhNjE5MWMyYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/324903088b8ba7edfc45b9c272a2c5d0ebf1cbbe","sha":"324903088b8ba7edfc45b9c272a2c5d0ebf1cbbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/324903088b8ba7edfc45b9c272a2c5d0ebf1cbbe"}],"sha":"e4809e667817b34a51b1073c55d23cca6191c2b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/e4809e667817b34a51b1073c55d23cca6191c2b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/324903088b8ba7edfc45b9c272a2c5d0ebf1cbbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T17:46:47Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T17:46:47Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"docs: incorporate expert review feedback into CI/CD plan\n\nAdditions based on Principal/Staff-level architect review:\n\n1. Core Invariant: Explicitly state \"main is always releasable\"\n\n2. Environment Invariants: Document what must stay identical between\n   staging and production to prevent drift\n\n3. Mobile Staging Scope: Clarify that mobile staging validates bundles\n   only, not distribution mechanics (intentional limitation)\n\n4. Architectural Trade-offs section documenting:\n   - Full E2E on every PR (correctness over speed)\n   - Rebuild vs promote artifacts (simpler, with mitigations)\n   - Double E2E execution (safety justification)\n\n5. Known Limitations section:\n   - Mobile app distribution testing scope\n   - Security scanning depth\n\n6. Future Enhancements section for scale:\n   - Change-aware E2E scoping\n   - Artifact promotion pipeline\n   - Release candidate tags\n   - Enhanced security scanning\n\nThe expert review confirmed the architecture is \"intentionally strict,\nnot naive\" with risks being \"social and scaling-related, not architectural\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36264e6cb9546110fed41dbc79489159e51c2bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/36264e6cb9546110fed41dbc79489159e51c2bd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/324903088b8ba7edfc45b9c272a2c5d0ebf1cbbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/324903088b8ba7