rchitecture:\n  - Mandatory E2E gates before merge (all platforms)\n  - Staging → Production two-stage deployment\n  - Platform parity (same gates for Web, Android, iOS)\n  - Zero manual steps (no labels required)\n  - Clear workflow specifications for 4 consolidated workflows\n\n- Add CI-CD-PREREQUISITES-MANUAL-STEPS.md with clear instructions:\n  - Vercel staging domain setup\n  - Firebase staging channel creation\n  - GitHub branch protection configuration\n\nThis is the planning phase for the CI/CD overhaul. Implementation\nwill follow after prerequisites are completed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"101e15620fc41baaeb5d562c848cce133c7a8680","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/101e15620fc41baaeb5d562c848cce133c7a8680"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/8991a9bdff5e6f8feb4a93040fc9fb5cc7b10b05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html