"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/0cebc1eda851e081600ff6e4bb4d32bebff93be1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T15:46:40Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T15:46:40Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): add emulator infrastructure fixes for E2E stability\n\nAndroid fixes:\n- Install missing Linux libraries (libvulkan1, libx11, etc.) required by Android Emulator\n- Add -no-snapshot-load to emulator options for clean cold boot\n- Restart ADB server before tests to fix \"device offline\" issues\n- Add retry logic for device boot with 60s timeout\n- Wait for package manager to be ready before APK install\n- Add retry logic for APK installation (3 attempts)\n- Verify app is installed before running Maestro tests\n\niOS fixes:\n- Add simulator state verification before app install\n- Add stability wait periods after boot and install\n- Verify app installation with fallback methods\n- Add diagnostic logging for troubleshooting\n\nThese fixes address the root cause of E2E failures where the app\nwas not launching properly in CI environment despite working locally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e63aa943d041794da31403f247b09625d87ac0f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/e63aa943d041794da31403f247b09625d87ac0f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/0cebc1eda851e081600ff6e4bb4d32bebff93be1","verification":{"payload":null,"re