","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/32d2767d970b59931e88844e9773001c65ab845d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T13:36:46Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T13:36:46Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(e2e): use login-unique selectors for extendedWaitUntil checks\n\nAddress PR feedback - use \"Forgot Password?\" (English) and \"पासवर्ड भूल गए?\"\n(Hindi) as login-unique selectors for extendedWaitUntil instead of generic\n\"Sign In\" text which also appears on other screens.\n\nThe \"Forgot Password?\" link only appears on the login screen, making it\na reliable selector to confirm navigation has completed to the login screen.\n\nUpdated files:\n- smoke.yaml: Wait for \"Forgot Password?\" before asserting login elements\n- navigation.yaml: Use \"Forgot Password?\" for both return-to-login waits\n- theming.yaml: Use \"Forgot Password?\" for all three return-to-login waits\n- i18n.yaml: Use \"Forgot Password?\" (English) and \"पासवर्ड भूल गए?\" (Hindi)\n  for locale-specific login detection\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5665f973a9b1f47191c6eb77fd65a365d352a8be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-20