,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/87e404690bc557bc652959d4426afbc5c454848b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T06:24:29Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T06:35:20Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): add google-services.json decoding for Firebase Auth in production\n\nThe production Android build was missing google-services.json because:\n1. The file is gitignored (correctly, for security)\n2. The CI/CD workflow wasn''t decoding it from secrets\n\nThis caused ALL Firebase authentication to fail in production builds:\n- Email/password login failed\n- Google Sign-In failed\n\nChanges:\n- Add GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON_BASE64 secret validation\n- Decode google-services.json before Android build\n- Clean up sensitive files after build\n\nAlso updated local google-services.json with both debug and release\nSHA-1 fingerprints for Google Sign-In to work with both keystores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2f4d778ddf6f558332c0bd62340eece77a6f175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/b2f4d778ddf6f558332c0bd62340eece77a6f175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/87e404690bc557bc652959d4426afbc5c454848b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"ve