s://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/13f588fa5d1e307340765c2bb0bb973c4f472f8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-01T06:24:29Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-01T06:24:29Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): add google-services.json decoding for Firebase Auth in production\n\nThe production Android build was missing google-services.json because:\n1. The file is gitignored (correctly, for security)\n2. The CI/CD workflow wasn''t decoding it from secrets\n\nThis caused ALL Firebase authentication to fail in production builds:\n- Email/password login failed\n- Google Sign-In failed\n\nChanges:\n- Add GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON_BASE64 secret validation\n- Decode google-services.json before Android build\n- Clean up sensitive files after build\n\nAlso updated local google-services.json with both debug and release\nSHA-1 fingerprints for Google Sign-In to work with both keystores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2f4d778ddf6f558332c0bd62340eece77a6f175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/b2f4d778ddf6f558332c0bd62340eece77a6f175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/13f588fa5d1e307340765c2bb0bb973c4f472f8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://a