_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T21:27:45Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(mf): add missing shared packages to Module Federation config\n\nThe Android release build was showing an endless spinner on the login\npage because shared-hello-ui''s dependencies were not marked as shared\nsingletons in the Module Federation configuration.\n\nWithout singleton configuration, release builds bundled separate\ninstances of shared packages, causing the LoginScreen component to\nuse a different auth store instance than the one initialized by the\nhost app. This resulted in isInitialized never being set to true.\n\nAdded to all host and remote configs:\n- @universal/shared-theme-context\n- @universal/shared-i18n\n- @universal/shared-auth-store\n- @universal/shared-a11y\n- @universal/shared-event-bus\n- @universal/shared-data-layer\n- @universal/shared-router\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9888d8ff873d841294ebbf6cb3db1eac6b22a828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/9888d8ff873d841294ebbf6cb3db1eac6b22a828"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/521bab8819cceb9a7ea2a00a18cf5dfada7e8043","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repo