/api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commits/0847c1a8042c95f82873207f70f05862e073bee9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T14:31:01Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T14:31:01Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(auth): improve OAuth error handling and add missing error codes\n\nAdded comprehensive error codes and user-friendly messages for OAuth errors:\n- auth/unauthorized-domain: Domain not authorized in Firebase Console\n- auth/operation-not-allowed: Provider not enabled in Firebase Console\n- auth/popup-blocked: Browser blocked the popup\n- auth/auth-domain-config-required: Missing auth domain configuration\n- auth/operation-not-supported: Browser doesn''t support this sign-in method\n- auth/internal-error: Internal Firebase error\n\nImproved error handling:\n- Added detailed console.error logging for OAuth failures (code, message, fullError)\n- Updated fallback message to be more helpful\n- Log unknown error codes in development mode for debugging\n\nUpdated documentation:\n- Added \"Authorized Domains\" section to Firebase setup prerequisites\n- Listed all domains that need to be added for OAuth to work\n\nTo fix Google/GitHub sign-in on Vercel:\n1. Go to Firebase Console → Authentication → Settings → Authorized domains\n2. Add your Vercel domain (e.g., your-app.vercel.app)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34a1b19713e47efdc5d5df41ca190b8b44c2cfe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/34a1b19713e47efdc5d5df41ca190b8b44c2cfe7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/0847c1a8042c95f82873207f70f05862e073bee9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/0847c1a8042c95f82873207f70f05862e073bee9","node_id":"C_kwDOQfmMHtoAKDA4NDdjMWE4MDQyYzk1ZjgyODczMjA3ZjcwZjA1ODYyZTA3M2JlZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/a2b328ae8cd3f37b08efbc99ee87f63be20f362d","sha":"a2b328ae8cd3f37b08efbc99ee87f63be20f362d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-20