fd520231ad67ba0bcdea5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T13:12:42Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T13:12:42Z","email":"pateatlau@gmail.com","name":"Patea Tlau"},"message":"fix(ci): add GoogleService-Info.plist creation step to iOS workflows\n\nThe iOS builds were failing because GoogleService-Info.plist is\ngitignored (correctly, for security) but was missing in CI.\n\nAdded the same GoogleService-Info.plist creation step that ci.yml\nalready has to:\n- deploy-ios.yml (for iOS release builds)\n- e2e-mobile.yml (for iOS E2E tests with Maestro)\n\nThe step will:\n1. Use GOOGLE_SERVICE_INFO_PLIST_BASE64 secret if available\n2. Fall back to a placeholder plist for CI builds if secret not set\n\nThis ensures iOS builds work in CI even without Firebase secrets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17ebaaa7aa4a4567c136f13c25c81a675e623546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/17ebaaa7aa4a4567c136f13c25c81a675e623546"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/483cb453889cbee1c60fd520231ad67ba0bcdea5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/rep