- Save intended destination in ProtectedRoute via location state\n   - Login pages now redirect back to original destination after auth\n   - Falls back to home if no destination saved\n\n4. Improve password strength bar width calculation readability\n   - Extract nested ternary into passwordStrengthWidth useMemo\n   - Use proper DimensionValue type for React Native\n\n5. Fix i18n interpolation in ForgotPasswordScreen\n   - Use params object for email interpolation as per TranslateOptions type\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"591dc3aa051b9432bd5bb02ca771bed2d045deeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/trees/591dc3aa051b9432bd5bb02ca771bed2d045deeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/git/commits/f487f55f12a8bddca4583c776cceae14ce69619f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810357?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau","id":810357,"login":"pateatlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDM1Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pateatlau","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pateatlau/universal-mfe-2026/commit/f487f55f12a8bddca458