ences to Upstash Redis and Ratelimit from the rate-limiting logic, transitioning to a MongoDB-only implementation for persistence.\n- Updated package.json and package-lock.json to eliminate unused Upstash packages.\n- Simplified error handling in the health check API by removing the error parameter from the catch block.\n- Added a 2-second delay in the image generation process to improve user experience.\n- Made minor adjustments to various components for consistency and clarity, including HTML entity updates in the FAQ and Terms pages.","tree":{"sha":"9688ca2fd78145a32bb7db8dfb08ed2af3907c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayupat13/NumeroVibe/git/trees/9688ca2fd78145a32bb7db8dfb08ed2af3907c27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mayupat13/NumeroVibe/git/commits/f8732ad0067a7b818f25ad151e8130b1d2032c2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22270616?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mayupat13","id":22270616,"login":"mayupat13","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjcwNjE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mayupat13","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mayupat13/NumeroVibe/commit/f8732ad0067a7b818f25ad151e8130b1d2032c2b","node_id":"C_