/api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/6d7f8885828b962370b125695e14556138e01938/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:26:12Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:26:12Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(privacy): §PRIVACY-SUDO backend — the platform account never sees a shop''s data\n\nYakot 2026-10-08: sudo \"Enter store\" was a privacy breach.\n- sudo is always storeless (User.save + migration users 0013 takes every super-admin out of its shop;\n  dev + prod sudo sat inside GATES as CASHIER and read all of GATES'' data)\n- X-Store-ID swap removed (auth + CORS header)\n- shop endpoints refuse sudo (RoleScopedPermission + role classes) — 403 with or without the header\n- tenant manager: storeless sudo gets NO rows through .objects (admin code uses all_objects)\n- admin: activity log without action/details · usage without revenue · sudo export endpoint removed ·\n  trash hides business names · Django admin drops sales/payments/expenses/shifts/refunds/purchases/\n  products/stock/suppliers/customers/activity log + the per-store search page\n- fixes: sessions 500 on a deleted user''s token · staff list with no store\n- tests 143/143 (8 new privacy tests) · check_isolation PASS\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06889ab9f5c5bbe48d63b026590cad1c1b14a15a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/06889ab9f5c5bbe48d63b026590cad1c1b14a15a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/6d7f8885828b962370b125695e14556138e01938","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":