bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/b3ed15401b9721730f74dba98e6930ab70798c18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:34:58Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:34:58Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"fix(till): checkout takes the payment in the SAME step; Ajel records no payment so it becomes customer debt (§AUDIT A2/A3)\n\nBefore: checkout ran with paid=0, then a 2nd call paid the FULL total with any method — Ajel included —\nso credit sales never became debt; with credit selling off EVERY till sale was refused; a cash sale\ncould be blocked by the credit limit. Payments endpoint now refuses Ajel, zero/negative, overpay,\nand non-posted invoices. Ajel needs a named customer. 7 tests + a real run on dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"557513d7ea5343ce65b3b64d7e24c02b8025120b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/557513d7ea5343ce65b3b64d7e24c02b8025120b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/b3ed15401b9721730f74dba98e6930ab70798c18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organiz