2026-06-29T05:00:53Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s148): §MB fluid table + §DE DrugProfile + enrichment script\n\nMemoryBase:\n- FluidDataTable.vue — reusable fluid table component (column resize/drag/\n  hide, preset save/load/assign, sort, pagination) via slots; works as the\n  shared engine for Products and any future table\n- MemoryBase.vue rewritten to use FluidDataTable: 7 columns (Drug Name,\n  Brand AR, Active Ing, Active Ing AR, Manufacturer, Category, Price),\n  own TABLE_ID ''inventory_memory_base'', category filter, Typesense-backed\n  search, Dedup+Import modals preserved; ~160 lines vs 240 before\n\nDrugProfile (§DE):\n- inventory.DrugProfile model: canonical per-drug packaging + medical\n  info (strips_per_pack, tablets_per_strip, side_effects, indications,\n  precautions, contraindications, drug_interactions — Arabic); no store FK\n- Product.drug_profile nullable FK (SET_NULL)\n- Migration inventory/0018_drugprofile\n- meds_catalog/enrich_drugs.py: Gemini 3.1 Flash-Lite, grounding OFF,\n  solid-dose filter (~60% of 26k drugs), 2.1s delay (≈28 RPM), 1400/run\n  limit, needs_review flag, resume-safe (skips already-enriched)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3fd245eb4a1ce017479e0b1bed9111004c386f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/3fd245eb4a1ce017479e0b1bed9111004c386f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/36d21d7c45c2df79b34c64c621cf4cdbd3f3b81a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users