ez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/5e29456ca7720b78aa527c6a27c5e1a30762e6a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:43:49Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:43:49Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s145): §POS-UI clock setting + footer status bar + changelog/docs\n\nPOS clock 12h/24h now a store setting (StoreSettings.pos_clock_24h,\nmigration core.0026, default 24h) — Settings → POS → Cart Display card;\nPOS nowStr() reads it (en-GB 24h / en-US 12h AM/PM). New POS footer status\nbar: cart lines/units, grand total, online/offline (window listeners) and\nkeyboard-shortcut hints. i18n EN+AR (pos.foot.*, settings.cart_display\nclock keys + a full new ar cart_display block). Changelog 1.23.0/1.24.0/\n1.24.1/1.25.0/1.26.0; STATUS/TODO/MustTest updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e63c1c15053c48a595eeb34a09a147a8ccafa77d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/e63c1c15053c48a595eeb34a09a147a8ccafa77d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/5e29456ca7720b78aa527c6a27c5e1a30762e6a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pin