kez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/81bd9fb4879a2a54b1449cb6c7427fef0aa87e91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T12:35:18Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T12:35:18Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s145): §POS-AR — Arabic search in POS + attribute reindex fix\n\nPOS search now uses the Typesense-backed autocomplete action (new ?pos=1\nmode: STORE-only, hidden products excluded, SKU/barcode matched for the\nscanner, 2-char trigger). Dropdown shows Arabic trade name + EN name +\nArabic ingredient when typed in Arabic (mirrors §AC-AR). Fixed a real\nindexing-timing bug: ProductAttribute writes (brand_ar/active_ing_ar)\nhappen after the Product save, so freshly created/received drugs were\nindexed with empty Arabic fields — added post_save/post_delete signals on\nProductAttribute to re-index the parent product. Also fixes the same gap\nin the New Purchase / Memory Base autocomplete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f6fd53b5159f1d4735f47bf6b07c0602b06b481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/6f6fd53b5159f1d4735f47bf6b07c0602b06b481"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/81bd9fb4879a2a54b1449cb6c7427fef0aa87e91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}"