ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/5b8e516f706ca857456f69b2925fe08f33e410b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:48:39Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:48:39Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s142): §SEARCH-TS — Typesense typo-tolerant search (VPS-wide, single collection)\n\nTypesense 30.2 installed as a localhost-only systemd service on the box; new\nDjango `search/` app indexes products into ONE collection tagged by store_id +\nsource (mirrors the autocomplete query). Autocomplete tries Typesense first\n(typo-tolerant, EN + Arabic) and falls back to pg_trgm on any error — same JSON\nshape, zero frontend change. Signals keep the index in sync (fail-safe: indexing\nerrors can never break a product write). `manage.py ts_reindex` rebuilds it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23f284a83019acae2dd0a97375c61fe399324163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/23f284a83019acae2dd0a97375c61fe399324163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/5b8e516f706ca857456f69b2925fe08f33e410b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","i