riptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/766394da256e2aed1ca1a44bd96a089d6ede0db0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:23:38Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:23:38Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s141): §MB-TWIN — autocomplete source setting + twin fix\n\nTwo new StoreSettings fields (migration 0025): autocomplete_source\n(memory_base|store_history, default memory_base) + mb_auto_register\n(bool, default True).\n\nProductAutocompleteView updated: memory_base mode searches all products\nand ranks STORE above MB via _src_rank annotation; store_history mode\nfilters STORE-only and returns no_history=true when empty. Response\nshape changed from plain array to {results, no_history} — backward\ncompatible (Purchases.vue already uses res.data.results ?? res.data).\n\nregister_memory_base_entry gated on mb_auto_register.\n\nCapabilities.vue: new Search & Autocomplete card with mode-btn source\ntoggle + mb_auto_register checkbox + ? explainer. i18n EN+AR.\nPurchases.vue: ac-no-history inline hint when store_history returns 0\nresults. Changelog 1.19.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"721ed2c543275bd5119a93c3cf1e3fd53428b2b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/721ed2c543275bd5119a93c3cf1e3fd53428b2b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/766394da256e2aed1ca1a44bd96a089d6ede0db0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pi