://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/322f4115baf3bd2b18eebd10062d96c92c4e7513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T05:11:53Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T05:11:53Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s131): §SUPERFIX foundation — wipe command + SKU flip + drop govt prices\n\nPharmacy/meds UX overhaul kickoff (see superfix.md → SESSION LOG). Foundation\nonly; NOT deployed, DB NOT wiped yet.\n\n- §1.2 inventory/management/commands/wipe_catalog.py — hard TRUNCATE…RESTART\n  IDENTITY CASCADE over 26 product/category/invoice tables; dry-run by default,\n  --execute to wipe; keeps stores/users/settings + config. Not executed.\n- §1.3/1.4 _generate_sku() flipped to product(4)+supplier(3)+store(3)\n  (1515400100); endswith-match on trailing 6 digits; test + manage.py check pass.\n- §1.5 seed_fast.py stops seeding govt prices (all prices 0).\n- §1.6 (last-known-price autofill) moved to §4; §1.7 (reseed) merged into §2.\n- Docs: superfix.md SESSION LOG + re-ordered plan, STATUS.md resume target,\n  TODO.md changelog. 5/44 sub-steps. Next: §2.1 Memory Base model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"660f52e7e1caf582a0ae4aa369ea6cdcff04434e"