pe de-emphasis) + parked per-invoice AP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1696e5ed99a1373add2e2ad9fb8a5b74d35cc25a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/1696e5ed99a1373add2e2ad9fb8a5b74d35cc25a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/0df9ef4780b897dcd8158112651cb80ca1594fe2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/0df9ef4780b897dcd8158112651cb80ca1594fe2","node_id":"C_kwDOQfsl89oAKDBkZjllZjQ3ODBiODk3ZGNkODE1ODExMjY1MWNiODBjYTE1OTRmZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2","sha":"dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2"}],"sha":"0df9ef4780b897dcd8158112651cb80ca1594fe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/0df9ef4780b897dcd8158112651cb80ca1594fe2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:27:54Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:27:54Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s127): §PH3 supplier payable — running-account payments\n\nAudit: supplier outstanding balance + purchase-history statement + the\nfrontend display already existed. Two gaps closed:\n\n1. Record supplier payment (running-account model, Yakot''s call): new\n   finance.SupplierPayment (migration 0011) recorded against the supplier\n   as a whole, not allocated per-invoice. SupplierPaymentViewSet (MANAGER\n   write / ADMIN delete, ?supplier= filter) at /api/finance/supplier-payments/.\n   SupplierDetail.vue: Record Payment button + modal (amount/date/method/note)\n   + payments history table with delete + mini-statement info card\n   (Total Purchased / Total Paid / Outstanding). EN+AR i18n.\n\n2. Balance bug: SupplierViewSet counted ALL non-deleted purchases incl.\n   DRAFT; AP-aging counted RECEIVED-only. Now balance = Sum(RECEIVED\n   purchase totals) - Sum(payments) via two Subqueries (no join blow-up),\n   consistent with AP-aging. Serializer exposes received_total/payments_total.\n\nVerified: rolled-back shell test (payment 225->125, DRAFT excluded stays\n125, receive ->375, zero rejected 400) + Playwright (record 50 -> Cash row\n+ outstanding 225->175, delete cleans up, 0 console errors). Build + Django\ncheck clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28e9349a32cb3a588a69cccf62341f1551d9400c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/28e9349a32cb3a588a69cccf62341f1551d9400c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2","node_id":"C_kwDOQfsl89oAKGRjZjk4MWI0ZTY4ZDA0Mzg0NWM4OTcyMDI5MGJhN2U5NWQ2YzJhZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f","sha":"326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f"}],"sha":"dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/dcf981b4e68d043845c89720290ba7e95d6c2ae2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:59:55Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:59:55Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"fix(s127): §PH2 stock ledger reconciles for multi-unit purchases\n\nStockLedgerView showed PURCHASE/SALE/RETURN rows in raw transaction\nunits (e.g. 10 packs) while StockLevel moves in base units (200 tablets).\nFor factor=1 products it matched; for Strip/Pack pharmacy products the\nrunning balance drifted from real stock. Multiply qty x unit_factor on\nall three so the ledger is base-unit throughout and closing_balance\nreconciles with live StockLevel.\n\nAudit verdict: the purchase->stock path was already correct end-to-end\n(frontend unit picker -> serializer freezes unit_factor -> receive engine\nconverts to base + credits StockLevel/batches). The ledger report was the\nonly disconnect.\n\nVerified: rolled-back shell test (10 Strips -> +200 base, ledger row 200,\nclosing balance == StockLevel) + Playwright (unit dropdown renders\nTablet/Strip(x20)/Pack(x40) on a purchase line, 0 console errors).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f8be7cd4563910bb0440439fd4ad95d32abbc59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/8f8be7cd4563910bb0440439fd4ad95d32abbc59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f","node_id":"C_kwDOQfsl89oAKDMyNmI4NTFlYTQ2NGM5Y2RiNDhkZTNkMTA0M2M1Mjc4OWM1NzQwNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/00a86fd6bc7cb4ea7f49b48eb77927d5284d9179","sha":"00a86fd6bc7cb4ea7f49b48eb77927d5284d9179","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/00a86fd6bc7cb4ea7f49b48eb77927d5284d9179"}],"sha":"326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/326b851ea464c9cdb48de3d1043c52789c57405f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/00a86fd6bc7cb4ea7f49b48eb77927d5284d9179/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:44:26Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T18:44:26Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s126): §PH1 stock-edit integrity pass\n\nAudited every stock-write path — the feared \"direct stock field bypassing\nthe ledger\" was already closed. Fixed the 3 real gaps found instead:\n\n- A: Products.vue swallowed a failed opening-stock adjustment (saved at 0,\n  toast lied \"Saved\") -> warning toast (showWarningToast + .app-toast-warning)\n- B: branch transfers were invisible in the Stock Movement Ledger report ->\n  added TRANSFER_OUT/IN half-moves in reports/views.py\n- C: new StockAdjustment.Reason.OPENING (migration inventory.0014) for\n  initial/imported stock instead of COUNT_CORRECTION\n\nGitignored apk/ + index.xapk (233M PH6 source). Changelog 1.10.1.\nDjango check + build clean; backend shell test ALL PASS; Playwright verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a3e8806df2890fc0ba9674c5bc70120700cfa37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/8a3e8806df2890fc0ba9674c5bc70120700cfa37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/00a86fd6bc7cb4ea7f49b48eb77927d5284d9179","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c