S/void\nengine untouched), sell_price per kg, decimal qty. is_weight_selling_enabled\ngate + build_selling_units weight branch (single kg unit, packs suppressed).\nWrite-serializer validation (force unit=kg, reject packs, fall back to UNIT\nwhen switch off). Editor Selling-Mode toggle + POS weight keypad modal.\nMigration inventory.0011. Changelog 1.4.0 + i18n EN/AR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7eb7d62393c3671a0a1b715ea9d7595f361a1342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/7eb7d62393c3671a0a1b715ea9d7595f361a1342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/11e0535ab0ab4b353a14db0cca166d9384db114e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/11e0535ab0ab4b353a14db0cca166d9384db114e","node_id":"C_kwDOQfsl89oAKDExZTA1MzVhYjBhYjRiMzUzYTE0ZGIwY2NhMTY2ZDkzODRkYjExNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com