it_factor (_resolve_unit). Purchases UI gets a per-line unit dropdown; get_items round-trips unit+selling_units.\n- Storage guard: move_to_storage blocks expiry-tracked variants (batch-blind). Expiry report+scan gated on master switch (old batches preserved/hidden when off).\n- Changelog: version numbers (1.1.0 multi-unit, 1.2.0 expiry, 1.2.1 Phase A) + version badge on page; new entry + i18n keys bilingual EN/AR.\n- No migration. Build + Django check clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76534eab8ff4eadd81be8dd1f1e357e2ac4677dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/76534eab8ff4eadd81be8dd1f1e357e2ac4677dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/15098ab1f4f06c50f415b21183ffec207c994ad6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/15098ab1f4f06c50f415b21183ffec207c994ad6","node_id":"C_kwDOQfsl89oAKDE1MD