heckbox (gated by store switch); product\n  detail Expiry Batches (FEFO) card with status pills.\n- Purchases: per-line expiry date + batch no. capture for tracked products\n  (threaded through finance serializer _apply_lines).\n- POS Pay modal: dedicated expired-stock block message.\n- New Reports → Expiry & Batches page (value tiles, status/window filters,\n  Scan now button) + route + sidebar link.\n- Bilingual EN/AR i18n keys throughout; What''s New changelog entry.\n\nDocs: STATUS s98, TODO changelog, MustTest click-through queue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2ea11e4f426d50977d6e6280f9f0e052bc5f80a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/a2ea11e4f426d50977d6e6280f9f0e052bc5f80a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/3acb8bac759efc563d96415c5c722d9c383c0736","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/3acb8bac759efc563d96415c5c722d9c383c0736","node_id":"C_kwDOQfsl89oAKDNhY2I4YmFjNzU5ZWZjNTYzZDk2NDE1YzVjNzIyZDljMzgzYzA3MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commit/5ed74e48de4fd92fa7b18f2bab467ca043d77ee0","sha":"5ed74e48de4fd92fa7b18f2bab467ca043d77ee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/5ed74e48de4fd92fa7b18f2bab467ca043d77ee0"}],"sha":"3acb8bac759efc563d96415c5c722d9c383c0736","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/3acb8bac759efc563d96415c5c722d9c383c0736"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/5ed74e48de4fd92fa7b18f2bab467ca043d77ee0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T13:39:10Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T13:39:10Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"feat(inventory): pharmacy expiry/batch FEFO engine — backend\n\nOpt-in per-batch expiry tracking with FEFO draw-down. Stock becomes a set of\ndated batches (StockBatch, base units) that sum to the cached StockLevel total.\n\n- core: StoreSettings.expiry_tracking_enabled master switch (default off →\n  feature dormant, non-pharmacy stores untouched) + expired_sale_policy\n  (ALLOW/WARN/BLOCK) + expiry_alert_days.\n- inventory: Product.track_expiry flag, StockBatch model, is_expiry_tracked()\n  two-gate helper, draw_from_batches()/restock_to_batch() FEFO engine,\n  batch-aware StockAdjustment (FEFO draw on loss, batch on gain).\n- finance: PurchaseItem expiry_date/batch_number → batch on receive;\n  SaleBatchConsumption ledger; handle_sale_stock FEFO draw + true-batch COGS;\n  VOID replays consumption to exact origin batches; refund restock.\n- finance/views: checkout BLOCK guard rejects sales drawing expired stock.\n- reports: /reports/expiry (expiring-soon/expired + valuation) + manual\n  /reports/expiry/scan notification button. New EXPIRY notification type.\n- serializers expose track_expiry, batches, purchase/adjustment expiry fields.\n\nVerified end-to-end on shell: FEFO spans batches, COGS=true batch cost,\nvoid restores exact batches, opt-out + master-switch dormancy confirmed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8ebf4a238993e8589669a30e92d1cbba27fe65a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/f8ebf4a238993e8589669a30e92d1cbba27fe65a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/5ed74e48de4fd92fa7b18f2bab467ca043d77ee0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","