ttps://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/3af89c29c3057e79133e3d8c217e37d78f5fd19e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T12:58:58Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T12:58:58Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"s97: Multi-Unit-of-Measure (UoM) engine — opt-in selling units\n\nStock counted in base unit; products define alternate selling units (factor +\nprice). All stock-touch points convert qty×factor→base (sale, void, purchase,\nrefund, negative-stock guard). Per-unit COGS. POS unit picker + unit-keyed cart\nlines. Product-Edit Selling Units section. Backward-compatible (factor 1 = old).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7153f0ee5732a5b497df9c7fc76fd414aa65eb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/d7153f0ee5732a5b497df9c7fc76fd414aa65eb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/3af89c29c3057e79133e3d8c217e37d78f5fd19e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincak