2026-06-15T17:40:04Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T17:40:04Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"feat(pos): per-item + invoice discounts, calculator keypad, compact layout; tax on net\n\n- Cart: per-line discount (%/fixed/free) + invoice discount as type+value;\n  additive toggle (default shield) — invoice discount skips already-discounted lines\n- DiscountModal: context (invoice|line) + Free tab; previews shield-aware\n- PosNumpad: touch input emits to search; KEYPAD→CALCULATOR mode (safe parser,\n  + - × ÷ C CE =, F1 to exit); physical keys routed in calc mode\n- POS.vue: % cart column, additive checkbox, scale(0.78) compact wrapper,\n  numpad wiring, payload sends line discount_amount; openPayment flushes draft sync\n- finance: VAT now charged on the net AFTER discounts (Egyptian VAT Law 67/2016) —\n  _recalculate nets each line + allocates invoice discount pro-rata; _apply_line_tax removed\n- en/ar locale keys; STATUS/TODO/MustTest updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7622ea7edcfdadef059fa5b42606fb437a4a44c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/7622ea7edcfdadef059fa5b42606fb437a4a44c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/58ab094e8c6964304a000ebaa7c586a4966fdc86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organization