iew_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/commits/79bb1456feaba8f81715a81edc8f4d20df74b5b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T15:46:24Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T15:46:24Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"feat: Purchases — create-or-find autocomplete item entry + supplier-gated SKUs\n\nTurn the purchase modal into a bulk product-onboarding flow:\n- Free-form autocomplete: pick existing product = restock, type new = create\n  product inline (category/sub-category/attributes, base cost + retail price)\n- Supplier-gated SKUs: no-supplier new items are STAGED in PurchaseInvoice.draft_items\n  (no SKU, not real inventory); materialized into Product+Variant+PurchaseItem the\n  moment a supplier is assigned\n- Per-supplier auto purchase_number (code_prefix + running counter) via new\n  PurchaseSequence; manual override supported; vendor_reference kept separate\n- Save as Draft (park) vs Save Purchase (save + receive stock); print-labels-now\n  checkbox + copies multiplier (supplier-gated)\n- Shared inventory/product_service.create_product_with_variant reused by\n  ProductWriteSerializer (single source of truth)\n- Fix latent bug: receive() referenced non-existent invoice.invoice_number\n- Branch now resolved server-side (user.default_branch / store Main)\n\nBackend verified via APIClient; UI flows logged in MustTest.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5afaad9a32b8b67e2e62ba1b99ea014f857f3061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/5afaad9a32b8b67e2e62ba1b99ea014f857f3061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/79bb1456feaba8f81715a81edc8f4d20df74b5b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc