r":{"date":"2026-06-14T23:45:47Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"POS redesign: floating cards, cart attributes, feedback numpad, tactile polish\n\n- POS.vue: 3 columns now rounded floating cards w/ inset gap + shadow; cart\n  rows are shadowed cards; white top-down add-flash (was full-screen orange);\n  add slides down from search bar, delete drops down (ease-in-out); fix Pay\n  button anchoring to panel bottom (height:100% + numpad margin-top:auto)\n- Cart lines now show chosen attributes/category (carried via cart store)\n- New PosNumpad.vue: cosmetic feedback keypad, white flash on key/click/touch,\n  NumLock-state chip, no NumLock key\n- Merge POS settings into tabbed /settings/pos (Top Selling/Favorites/\n  Cart Display/Keyboard); collapse 3 sidebar links into one; legacy redirects\n- New Cart Display tab: pick up to 4 fields (attrs+category) w/ live preview\n- Fix latent bug: StoreSettingsSerializer omitted pos_top_selling_* so that\n  settings page silently saved nothing; now exposed + new pos_cart_display_fields\n- core migration 0019; i18n keys added\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c289d2666f30eccc900eb0d7e9e26b5a1194ad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/2c289d2666f30eccc900eb0d7e9e26b5a1194ad3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/507b84b095d219e7aeb4d3a42094a75283c18e45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"