mmitter":{"date":"2026-06-13T15:39:58Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"feat(i18n): Phase 1 complete — tunnel + backend language field + frontend selectors\n\n§0a Vite tunnel:\n- Named Cloudflare tunnel ''ventest'' (80401e21) created + config.yml updated\n- DNS CNAME ventest.gatesinnov.com updated to new tunnel UUID (via VPS API)\n- dev-start.sh script: kills :5173 → starts Vite → starts cloudflared → prints URLs\n\nArabic Phase 1 backend:\n- User.language field (en/ar, default en) + migration 0011\n- UserProfileSerializer includes ''language'' (readable + writable)\n- LocaleMiddleware added to MIDDLEWARE (after Session, before Common)\n  so Django reads Accept-Language header and returns errors in Arabic\n\nArabic Phase 1 frontend:\n- auth.js setUser: applies user.language to i18n locale + localStorage on login/bootstrap\n- Login.vue: EN | AR pill toggle (pre-login, client-side only)\n- Profile.vue: Interface Language pills → PATCH /api/auth/me/ + instant locale switch\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ef3e50908b8ce05308c309abe9d329b8504c95c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/trees/ef3e50908b8ce05308c309abe9d329b8504c95c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-backend/git/commits/3548eea3e6bfb7507b56e390386e085d9e16eb3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use