ttps://api.github.com/repos/ar-shenoy/somAI/commits/f448d769cbfc6edcb96a144e71e78716648e8a06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T10:33:45Z","email":"110891430+ar-shenoy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Adarsh R Shenoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T10:33:45Z","email":"110891430+ar-shenoy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Adarsh R Shenoy"},"message":"feat: Enhance AI interaction with new features and UI\n\nIntroduces several improvements to the SomAI application:\n\n- **Backend Configuration:** Adds support for separate API endpoints for text and media processing, allowing for more flexible model deployment.\n- **UI Enhancements:**\n    - Implements a global status message display for better user transparency during processing.\n    - Improves the BP sync logic to handle zero or partial inputs gracefully.\n    - Adds a \"scroll to bottom\" functionality in the chat interface.\n    - Introduces a loading indicator for speech generation.\n- **Functionality:**\n    - Enables speech generation for AI responses.\n    - Integrates a document upload feature with progress reporting.\n    - Updates internal model names for clarity and potential future tiered usage.","tree":{"sha":"42cc8d2e5ee133b2f32f4fcb0b3ba0fa45fd01a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ar-shenoy/somAI/git/trees/42cc8d2e5ee133b2f32f4fcb0b3ba0fa45fd01a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ar-shenoy/somAI/git/commits/f448d769cbfc6edcb96a144e71e78716648e8a06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110891430?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com