r","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ar-shenoy/somAI/commits/f49486ec1f751dd0fb07baef6226a963eade71c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-03T09:47:16Z","email":"110891430+ar-shenoy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Adarsh R Shenoy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-03T09:47:16Z","email":"110891430+ar-shenoy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Adarsh R Shenoy"},"message":"feat: Enhance patient profile and AI service capabilities\n\nThe PatientProfile interface has been significantly expanded to capture more comprehensive user data, including contact details, detailed medical history (surgeries, family history, medications), lifestyle factors (diet, exercise, smoking, alcohol), and enhanced gamification metrics.\n\nThe `geminiService.ts` has been updated to:\n- Improve API key retrieval for both client and server environments.\n- Introduce a fallback API mechanism to ensure service availability.\n- Implement image compression functionality.\n- Define new types for health insights extraction and chat session management.\n- Add functions for generating health insights and session names, and for waking up the backend service.\n\nThese changes provide a more robust foundation for personalized patient education and AI-driven health analysis within the SomAI application.","tree":{"sha":"6a017e05a55bb685ac4cdd302e7540b7b6f81d75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ar-shenoy/somAI/git/trees/6a017e05a55bb685ac4cdd302e7540b7b6f81d75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ar-shenoy/somAI/git/commits/f49486ec1f751dd0fb07baef6226a963eade71c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110891430?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ar-shenoy/followers","following_url