ace issues\n\n- Add yamllint validation to ConfigMap generation process\n  - Validates all generated YAML files immediately after creation\n  - Fails generation if validation errors are found\n  - Ensures files pass pipeline linters (no trailing spaces, valid syntax)\n- Fix trailing whitespace in app_caddy.template.j2 using Jinja2 whitespace control\n- Add yamllint>=1.35.0 as a core dependency\n- Update README documentation with YAML validation features\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* clean up gitignore\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4cf28d7ab189ce5d1f60643fe5fce0e31ba217f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catastrophe-brandon/plumber/git/trees/b4cf28d7ab189ce5d1f60643fe5fce0e31ba217f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catastrophe-brandon/plumber/git/commits/11e61f1852c32d749b5b7fc95b5860e09d5faada","verification":{"payload":"tree b4cf28d7ab189ce5d1f60643fe5fce0e31ba217f\nparent b476003eddc9e9aff56f5759c8d77b6f033fb0c8\nauthor Brandon Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1768950210 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768950210 -0600\n\nIncorporate paths from frontend.yaml, if present (#7)\n\n* Updates to incorporate pulling application paths from frontend.yaml when present\n\n* Fix formatting issues and add a script to install a git hook\n\n* Add YAML validation and fix trailing whitespace issues\n\n- Add yamllint validation to ConfigMap generation process\n  - Validates all generated YAML files immediately after creation\n  - Fails generation if validation errors are found\n  - Ensures files pass pipeline linters (no trailing spaces, valid syntax)\n- Fix trailing whitespace in app_caddy.template.j2 using Jinja2 whitespace control\n- Add yamllint>=1.35.0 as a core dependency\n- Update README documentation with YAML validation features\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* clean up gitignore\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <n