ll pipelines (#6)\n\n* Refactor to generate ConfigMaps instead of full pipelines\n\n- Generate two separate ConfigMaps: app Caddyfile and proxy routes\n- Add namespace support via optional CLI parameter\n- Proxy ConfigMap uses ''routes'' data key (matching production)\n- Include YAML document separator (---) for yamllint compliance\n- Remove pipeline template dependencies (Konflux/Minikube)\n- Simplify generation logic using templates for both configs\n- Update CLI with --app-configmap-name and --proxy-configmap-name\n- Add comprehensive ConfigMap generation tests\n- Update documentation and example scripts\n\nThis makes the tool more flexible and reusable across different\npipeline systems (Tekton, GitHub Actions, etc.).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix line length for ruff linter\n\nBreak long line in generate_configmap() to comply with 100 character\nlimit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a49ac1213810bb0f5e5f3fcb82d3c90ba76ca677","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catastrophe-brandon/plumber/git/trees/a49ac1213810bb0f5e5f3fcb82d3c90ba76ca677"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catastrophe-brandon/plumber/git/commits/b476003eddc9e9aff56f5759c8d77b6f033fb0c8","verification":{"payload":"tree a49ac1213810bb0f5e5f3fcb82d3c90ba76ca677\nparent cc97c38edd843e673afb9b86a65c87e53a6dab75\nauthor Brandon Tweed <btweed@redhat.com> 1768506936 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1768506936 -0600\n\nRHCLOUD-44275: Refactor to generate ConfigMaps instead of full pipelines (#6)\n\n* Refactor to generate ConfigMaps instead of full pipelines\n\n- Generate two separate ConfigMaps: app Caddyfile and proxy routes\n- Add namespace support via optional CLI parameter\n- Proxy ConfigMap uses ''routes'' data key (matching production)\n- Include YAML document separator (---) for yamllint compliance\n- Remove pipeline template 